      ],
      "comment": "A recorded alternative, like <strong lang=\"la\">caffēa</strong>; the draft explicitly marks their <strong lang=\"la\">ē</strong>. The unmarked spelling <strong lang=\"la\">coffea</strong> there does not establish an equally certain stem quantity."
    },
